  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ProjectCircle.Systems.Dialogue
  speaker: Reflection
  lines:
  - No corners. No name. Just this round, quiet shape.
  - They cast me out for being nothing.
  - ...Then why does the old one look at me like I'm the only thing left that's real?
